{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/d46ef59e53fb96dfa5dca680e7a1da78.poster.avif?t=1771499229\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/d46ef59e53fb96dfa5dca680e7a1da78.webm?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/d46ef59e53fb96dfa5dca680e7a1da78.mp4?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft devastating magic from the three primordial orbs. With 10 spell combinations per run, you forge your arsenal on the fly\u2014 scale your spells to infinity, tear through the horde in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/6e86d30c8e5728ede1884b2d6c9ab138.poster.avif?t=1771499229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/6e86d30c8e5728ede1884b2d6c9ab138.webm?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/6e86d30c8e5728ede1884b2d6c9ab138.mp4?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of up to four and turn the battlefield into a slaughterfest. Synergize your spells and crush the horde together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/e431f1f1bdb48759fd00969adbfc5929.poster.avif?t=1771499229\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/e431f1f1bdb48759fd00969adbfc5929.webm?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/e431f1f1bdb48759fd00969adbfc5929.mp4?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot powerups and burst open chests as the horde grows out of control. Ring the bell to push the run five minutes further, empowering the forces of darkness and raising the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/8e0c256f850bb919578e881df2421c92.poster.avif?t=1771499229\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/8e0c256f850bb919578e881df2421c92.webm?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/extras/8e0c256f850bb919578e881df2421c92.mp4?t=1771499229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+100 challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 realms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 bosses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2551250?t=1771499229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/e4cb91e2d6d559db42b3901721a2e7e4cc7e133c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771499229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551250/ceb5f88eafa5b57